  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c431639d01c88a18a74c-913233df.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice tomato into thin rounds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c431639d01c88a18a74c-4fcb828a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• In a medium bowl, combine haloumi, All-American spice blend, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c431639d01c88a18a74c-5a8d6770.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When fries have 10 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c431639d01c88a18a74c-99d33c7f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While haloumi is cooking, halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c431639d01c88a18a74c-9e90bbf2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread garlic aioli on the base of each burger bun. Top with haloumi, chimichurri sauce, tomato and mixed salad leaves.\n• Serve with fries. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c431639d01c88a18a74c-08c84e4a.jpeg"
    }
  ]
